                <span begin="01:52.870" end="01:54.167">won't </span>
                <span begin="01:54.167" end="01:57.126">forget</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们的故事，铭刻在石碑之上将永远不会遗忘</span>
