                <span begin="02:17.901" end="02:18.292">light </span>
                <span begin="02:18.292" end="02:18.663">my </span>
                <span begin="02:18.663" end="02:19.556">sun</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为了你，我的光，我的太阳</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:19.556" end="02:21.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">
                <span begin="02:19.556" end="02:19.877">I'll </span>
                <span begin="02:19.877" end="02:21.765">sacrifice</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿意献出</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:21.765" end="02:25.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">
                <span begin="02:21.765" end="02:22.087">Eternal </span>
                <span begin="02:22.087" end="02:22.446">night </span>
                <span begin="02:22.446" end="02:22.782">my </span>
                <span begin="02:22.782" end="02:23.229">last </span>
