                <span begin="02:25.231" end="02:25.918">Survive </span>
                <span begin="02:25.918" end="02:26.335">you </span>
                <span begin="02:26.335" end="02:27.351">whispered</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">活下去，你低语</span>
